{"ID":"20240118144951-x66icwc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144951-x66icwc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144951-x66icwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144951-ujlmno3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171020-t02t2l4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122171020-t02t2l4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:107,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:107\u0026#125;","title":"381补24xie薤白","type":"doc","updated":"20240204171037"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144951-ujlmno3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144951-ujlmno3","updated":"20240122170909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"——调中助阳，散血生肌，泄下焦大肠气滞。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170912-ryzb1vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170912-ryzb1vh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，叶似韭而阔，多白而无实，入药去青留白。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170913-xfn5ldl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170913-xfn5ldl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛苦，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170915-4c2tlsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170915-4c2tlsl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】薤白为滑利散结要药，主胸痹剌痛，泄痢后重，温中助阳，下气散血，除寒热，治带下。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170920-nsrk5uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170920-nsrk5uu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" [1.治肺、心不可或缺的药。] "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170921-2sgy36r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170921-2sgy36r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】主金疮，疮败。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170923-ufokfur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170923-ufokfur"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】归骨，除寒热，去水气，温中散结气，作羹食利病人，诸疮中风寒水气肿痛，捣涂之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170925-niojkj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170925-niojkj5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】煮食耐寒，调中补不足，止久痢冷泻。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170927-2bhzse9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170927-2bhzse9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】治泄痢下重，能泄下焦阳明气滞。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170929-d6hnd52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170929-d6hnd52"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】心病宜食之，利产妇。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170930-dcpccpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170930-dcpccpy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】治女人带下赤白，作羹食之，骨哽在咽不去者，食之即下。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170932-4f0bywh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170932-4f0bywh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】白者补益，赤者疗金疮及风，生肌肉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170933-ctwgea5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170933-ctwgea5"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】与蜜同捣，涂汤火伤甚速。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170934-rikblyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170934-rikblyu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【药征】主治心胸痛而喘息咳唾也，旁治背痛，心中痞。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170936-6b0dozx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170936-6b0dozx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170937-gi495xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170937-gi495xi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】发热病不宜多食，不可与牛肉同食，令人作症瘕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170938-gcs4z8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170938-gcs4z8d"}},{"ID":"20240122170938-yehxmri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170938-yehxmri"}},{"ID":"20240122170938-937sh07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170938-937sh07","updated":"20240204170800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第24这个叫做薤白。薤白这个药呢，大家看看薤白这个药长成这个样子，哦薤白，拿起来感觉有点大蒜的味道，因为那个制过了，所以它颜色有点黄，原来薤白呢是纯白色的，纯白色的，有点大蒜的味道，那这个薤白呢主散结生肌，那张仲景在用薤白的时候，是在用治疗肺上面的，哦你看，它是主治滑利散结的要药，主要的药物。主胸痹剌痛，胸痹剌痛，心脏有问题也是刺痛啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170959-7vorf8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170959-7vorf8m","updated":"20240204170835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中医治疗心脏一定要去治疗肺，就好像我们治疗肝脏一定治疗脾，我们治疗心脏一定治疗肺，因为火和金嘛，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薤白是味辛苦，它是入肺的药，所以胸痹、胸闷痛，不管里面是瘀血堵到或者是有心脏病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，薤白是很主要的一个治疗胸口刺痛的一个药物。"}]},{"ID":"20240122171007-qyujqyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171007-qyujqyb","updated":"20240204171017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那个本草经呢，本经原文它说主金疮，那个。【别录】呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薤白呢专门治诸疮中风寒水气肿痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，都可以使用。一般来说我在使用上，张仲景在使用上大部分是治疗胸痹、胸闷、胸痛，还有刺痛，心脏病的刺痛，所以肺有问题或者是心脏有刺痛，通通可以使用薤白，那你要知道薤白的主要呢主治呢，最主要是滑利散结。有些病人告诉你说胸口闷闷的，郁闷的气在那里好像散不开在那里，这个时候你用薤白下去，马上就散开了，这就是薤白，它讲得就是薤白。"}]},{"ID":"20240122171020-t02t2l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122171020-t02t2l4","updated":"20240204171037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药征】"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主治心胸痛而喘息咳唾也"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，通通可以使用薤白，所以薤白我们在治疗心脏病，跟肺病的时候，是不可或缺的药，我用了很多，那一般使用的时候，你可以用三钱四钱都没有关系，薤白，那味道很重，煮起来汤里面有大蒜的味道很重。"}]}]}